# Dockerfile-specific build context filter.
# The build command uses the repository root as context, but the image does NOT
# need raw videos, datasets, processed videos, Git history, etc.

**

# Deployment files
!jetson-deployment/
!jetson-deployment/Dockerfile
!jetson-deployment/Dockerfile.dockerignore
!jetson-deployment/requirements-jetson.txt
!jetson-deployment/thermal_rtsp_analysis.py

# Root helper modules imported by the live RTSP application
!step_code.py
!step_02_configure_thermal_scale.py
!step_03_process_thermal_temperatures.py
